    {
      "name": "head-change-b-and-to-mix",
      "start": 561,
      "end": 752,
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "note": "The take opens on a stopped machine and stays with it.  Two seconds of dispense_hold pass with the mover parked over the waste chute and the camera barely breathing, so the cut reads as the film moving on rather than as the thing that started the next move.  Then head change B and the transfer that follows it, in one travelling take from the right: the camera moves in as the mover parks the pipetting head and picks the gripper back up, pulls back to catch the plate leaving the dispense stage, and settles as it lands on the mixer.  It closes on the second held beat, easing to a stop over a machine that has already stopped, and ends on mix_place_settle.",
